[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6600.47, "timestamp": "01:50:00", "text": "うん、それいいよね。これはまたデメリットにもなり得る"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6603.43, "timestamp": "01:50:03", "text": "質問のように与えられるのは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6606.55, "timestamp": "01:50:06", "text": "似たようなことが起こると"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6608.629, "timestamp": "01:50:08", "text": "YouTubeチャンネルを失うと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6610.47, "timestamp": "01:50:10", "text": "WSとあなたの努力とすべて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6612.51, "timestamp": "01:50:12", "text": "あなたならどうしますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6615.51, "timestamp": "01:50:15", "text": "質問ですね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6617.83, "timestamp": "01:50:17", "text": "あなたはそう思う、私はニクソンではないと思うが、私はそうは思わない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6621.669, "timestamp": "01:50:21", "text": "私は本当にそうは思わないと思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6623.83, "timestamp": "01:50:23", "text": "YouTubeチャンネルへのアクセスを失う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6625.43, "timestamp": "01:50:25", "text": "あなたは自分の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6627.35, "timestamp": "01:50:27", "text": "それを取り戻す力と、あなたを知っている私は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6629.573, "timestamp": "01:50:29", "author": "@notSojasu", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/9iC0_w5nBHNC4BhGgiYeUdW6ZfCOGIbrmqCvaFZ2PV9zycbIf4HhyAZJDeqpX-v3fXW6q93S=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "joq how many documents regarding classified information do you keep on your hard drives?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6629.75, "timestamp": "01:50:29", "text": "必ず取り戻せると分かっている。まるで私があなたを"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6631.59, "timestamp": "01:50:31", "text": "私が信頼して言える唯一の人、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6632.79, "timestamp": "01:50:32", "text": "「ああ、彼は自分のものを手に入れるだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6633.83, "timestamp": "01:50:33", "text": "チャンネルを戻してください。あなたは連絡を取るつもりです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6635.109, "timestamp": "01:50:35", "text": "適切な当局。あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6636.95, "timestamp": "01:50:36", "text": "適切な人にメールを送れば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6640.629, "timestamp": "01:50:40", "text": "それを取り戻すために。」 ええ。そしてもしそれがもし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6647.75, "timestamp": "01:50:47", "text": "大丈夫だと思う。つまり、私はただ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6650.229, "timestamp": "01:50:50", "text": "私は自分の動画のバックアップをすべて持っていることを知っています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6652.629, "timestamp": "01:50:52", "text": "などなど、でも私はかなり"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6654.51, "timestamp": "01:50:54", "text": "がっかりした、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6655.753, "timestamp": "01:50:55", "author": "@rockxraul", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/piRk3MW9j5q7Mcd_cXlRjEgFv3e-ZP1RhbrtKaHA2MhwsR7XpNboJI5PqW941yDRiBzSR87J=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "aight imma sleep now have a fun stream joq zen"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6658.95, "timestamp": "01:50:58", "text": "でも、それほど落ち込んではいないかもしれない。"}]